{"ref":"BDB, קִרְיָה","hw":"קִרְיָה","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">קִרְיָה</span></big>  <strong>n.f. town, city (</strong>syn. of <span dir=\"rtl\">עִיר</span>, chiefly poet., and in the higher style; perhaps from above √ as <em>meeting</em>-place of men; cf. n.pr.loc. MI<sup>13</sup> <span dir=\"rtl\">קרית</span>, l.<sup>10</sup> <span dir=\"rtl\">קריתן</span>; J.Aram. <span dir=\"rtl\">קַרְיָה</span><strong>)</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">ק׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 1:21\" href=\"/Isaiah.1.21\">Is 1:21</a> +; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">קִרְיַת</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 21:28\" href=\"/Numbers.21.28\">Nu 21:28</a> +;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  in gen. <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 2:36\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.2.36\">Dt 2:36</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 3:4\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.3.4\">3:4</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  of specif. towns, <a data-ref=\"Hosea 6:8\" href=\"/Hosea.6.8\">Ho 6:8</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">גִּלְעָד</span>, 𝔊<sup>Codd.</sup> Γαλγαλα, cf. Now); <span dir=\"rtl\">קִרְיַת סִיחֹן</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 21:28\" href=\"/Numbers.21.28\">Nu 21:28</a>; Damascus, <span dir=\"rtl\">ק׳ מְשׂוֹשִׂי</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 49:25\" href=\"/Jeremiah.49.25\">Je 49:25</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">עִיר תְּהִלָּה</span>); especially of Jerus. <a data-ref=\"Micah 4:10\" href=\"/Micah.4.10\">Mi 4:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 29:1\" href=\"/Isaiah.29.1\">Is 29:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 33:20\" href=\"/Isaiah.33.20\">33:20</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">רְחֹבוֹת ק׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 2:11\" href=\"/Lamentations.2.11\">La 2:11</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ק׳ מֶלֶךְ רָ֑ב</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 48:3\" href=\"/Psalms.48.3\">ψ 48:3</a>, city for inhab. <a data-ref=\"I Kings 1:41\" href=\"/I_Kings.1.41\">1 K 1:41</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 1:45\" href=\"/I_Kings.1.45\">45</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ק׳ נֶאֱמָנָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 1:21\" href=\"/Isaiah.1.21\">Is 1:21</a>, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 1:26\" href=\"/Isaiah.1.26\">26</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">עִיר הַצֶּדֶק</span>), <span dir=\"rtl\">ק׳ עַלִּיזָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 22:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.22.2\">22:2</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">עִיר הוֹמִיָּה</span>), <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 32:13\" href=\"/Isaiah.32.13\">32:13</a>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  in <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 24-26\" href=\"/Isaiah.24-26\">Is 24–26</a> coll., i.e. denoting various, representative, cities, <span dir=\"rtl\">ק׳ תֹּהוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 24:10\" href=\"/Isaiah.24.10\">24:10</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ק׳ בְּצוּרָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 25:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.25.2\">25:2</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ק׳ גּוֹיִם עָרִיצִים</span> v <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 25:3\" href=\"/Isaiah.25.3\">3</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ק׳ נִשְׂגָּבָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 26:5\" href=\"/Isaiah.26.5\">26:5</a>; so prob. <a data-ref=\"Habakkuk 2:8\" href=\"/Habakkuk.2.8\">Hb 2:8</a>, <a data-ref=\"Habakkuk 2:17\" href=\"/Habakkuk.2.17\">17</a>.<br><strong>4.</strong>  indef., <a data-ref=\"Habakkuk 2:12\" href=\"/Habakkuk.2.12\">Hb 2:12</a>, (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">עִיר</span>); <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 29:8\" href=\"/Proverbs.29.8\">Pr 29:8</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ק׳ עֹז</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 18:19\" href=\"/Proverbs.18.19\">18:19</a> <em>a city of strength</em>, so <span dir=\"rtl\">ק׳ עֻזּוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 10:15\" href=\"/Proverbs.10.15\">10:15</a> (in fig.) = <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 18:11\" href=\"/Proverbs.18.11\">18:11</a> (id.); = inhab., <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 11:10\" href=\"/Proverbs.11.10\">11:10</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">הֲמוֹן ק׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 39:7\" href=\"/Job.39.7\">Jb 39:7</a>.","next":"BDB, קִרְיַת","prev":"BDB, מְקָרֶה"}